**/roster.js
**/members/images/
**/team/assets/indi/

# --- Old duplicate of the site (not deployed; --NEW-- is the hosting root) ---
/box/
/--NEW--/box/

# --- Hulalla Night Market store + POS (not published) ---
/--NEW--/store/

